<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has</p>
<p>completed all six credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.597  bln pesos  11 days  31.88 pct</p>
<p>    1.597  bln pesos  10 days  31.79 pct</p>
<p>    1.598  bln pesos   6 days  31.59 pct</p>
<p>    2.000  bln pesos   5 days  31.59 pct</p>
<p>    1.500  bln pesos   4 days  31.49 pct</p>
<p>    1.000  bln pesos   3 days  30.97 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9500</p>
</text>
